 "title": "Appraiser's Office 17% Maintenance Review • Butler County, KS",
 "text": "Appraiser's Office 17% Maintenance Review • Butler County, KS\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\n-->\nVisitors\nResidents\nGovernment\nDepartments\nI Want To\nSearch\nEmployment\nE-Services\nAgenda Center\nAlerts Center\nApply for Diversion\nArchive Center\nCalendar\nEnergy Reduction Calculator\nCommunity Voice\nDocument Center\nePay\nFacilities\nFAQs\nJobs\nMedia Center\nNews Flash\nNotify Me\nOnline Forms\nOpinion Poll\nPhoto Gallery\nQuick Links\nReal Estate Locator\nRequest Tracker\nResource Directory\nStaff Directory\nDocuments\nForms\nHome\nNews Flash\nAppraiser's Office 17% Maintenance Review\nNews Flash\nAppraiser's Office 17% Maintenance Review\nHome\nPosted on February 18, 2026 | Last Updated on February 18, 2026\nThe Butler County Appraiser’s Office is conducting on-site inspections of real property as part of the 17% maintenance review.\nThe field staff will review the properties for accuracy of characteristic data and update records if necessary.\nThe review area is located from Turkey Creek Road to the western county boundary that is located between SW Parallel Street and SE/SW 60th Street. It excludes those properties that are located in and around southeast El Dorado that were relisted last year. The inspection areas include the towns of Benton, Towanda, and part of El Dorado that is south of 6th Ave and west of High Street.\nThe field staff can be identified with Butler County photo identification badges and will be driving vehicles that are marked with Butler County.\nProperty owners with questions may contact the Butler County Appraiser’s Office at (316) 322-4220.\nAppraiser's Office Webpage\nRelated News\nN Rose Hill Rd/SW Butler Rd Construction Work\nHome\nPosted on August 25, 2026 | Last Updated on August 25, 2026\nSW Ohio Street Rd & SW 20th St Project\nHome\nPosted on May 28, 2026 | Last Updated on May 28, 2026\nConstruction & Demolition (C & D) Landfill Closure\nHome\nPosted on February 10, 2026\nOnline Tag Renewals\nHome\nPosted on January 06, 2026\n-->\nAgendas & Minutes\nNotify Me®\nOnline Payments\nWe Listen\nEmployment\nStay Connected\nContact Us\n205 W Central Avenue\nEl Dorado, KS 67042\nPhone: 316-322-4300\nFax: 316-322-4387\nQuick Links\nCounty Profile\nEvents\nLandfill & Recycling\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHelpful Links\nHome\nSite Map\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nOpens in new window\nPDF Download\nWord Download\nExcel Download\nPowerPoint Download\nDocument Download\nExplore your accessibility options\nClose ×",
